   against gentle's 174. Close, and still two layouts to keep level. These two declarations
   instead restate exactly what app.scss's gentle `:has(.ll-appshell)` block sets --
   `calc(--topbar-height + 1rem)` and a shell clearance of 0 -- so the page computes the same
   26 + 0 + 40 + 40 = 106 in both layouts and there is one geometry to maintain, not two.
