   `.color_black` high-contrast mode — so any colour chosen for bare text is wrong on at
   least one of them. That is the bug in the screenshot: near-black copy on a dark slate
   board. Giving the panel its own card fixes the contrast once for every ground instead of
   once per theme. Measured on the card's darkest stop (#ECF1FA): message 10.70:1, the Try
   Again link 7.00:1; the card itself reads 6.91:1 against a mid-slate board ground.
