   the sentence bar, which anchors it via `.button_list { ... position: relative }`
   further down this file. It had to move out of the bar to stop nesting a
   role="button" inside an <a href> (no-nested-interactive). Without a containing
   block here the next positioned ancestor is the FIXED header: measured +776px
   left / +17.5px top on dev, landing it beside the account avatar.

