/* Board cards: fixed ~280px tiles that wrap to the next row when the content
   area is too narrow (same pattern as setup Board Category + legacy
   .board-picker-page). Overrides the base grid's fixed column counts, which
   forced three columns and clipped the right edge inside .md-card--home-boards
