/* Reports subheader now carries the Joined / Last active meta (the title is
   the "Communication activity for…" line). Inline items at the sub's own
   size — each a calendar icon / verdigris status dot + label + bold value. */
/* Compound `.md-hero__sub.md-hero__sub--meta` (0,4,0) beats the base
   `.md-hero--dashboard .md-hero__sub .md-hero__sub--from-right` rule
   (inline-block, 0,3,0) so the row actually becomes a flex row — without
   this the items baseline-align (calendar 16px vs dot 9px) and look
   vertically offset. align-items:center lines both items up on their
   vertical centers. The animation/opacity from the base rule still applies
   (only `display` is overridden here). */
.md-hero--reports-dashboard .md-hero__sub.md-hero__sub--meta .md-hero__sub--from-right,
.md-hero--org .md-hero__sub.md-hero__sub--meta .md-hero__sub--from-right {
