/* Selected state carries BOTH a fill and a border change, not colour alone: the two options
   are language names, so a user who cannot separate the two hues has nothing else to go on
   (WCAG 1.4.1). `aria-pressed` carries it for assistive tech. */
.la-languages-segmented__btn--on {
