  gap: 10px;
  /* Horizontal padding has to be declared here. The universal footer rule this class is
     registered in sets ONLY padding-top/bottom, and this footer carries no Bootstrap
     `.modal-footer` class to inherit a horizontal value from — so without this the buttons
     sat flush against the modal's right edge and the primary one clipped. Matches the body's
