/* Role-color modifiers — match the caseload action tile palette:
     Note     → blue   (communication / writing)
     Assess   → teal   (measurement / diagnostic)
     Prio     → violet (priority / setting)
     Retire   → coral  (completion)
     Restore  → teal   (revival)
     Delete   → coral  (destruction) */
