     behind a transparent symbol shows mint instead of the button's own colour.
     `docs/SYMBOL_IMPORT_SKIN_TONE_FINDINGS.md` already names this band as what masks that
     colour. Scoped to `.board.edit` so rendering is unchanged in both modes. */
}
