     translucent white background + backdrop blur + soft inset
     highlight + subtle outer shadow so the icon sits in a frosted
     glass tile on top of the sunken nb-section gradient behind it. */
  /* THE CARET BUTTON SHARES THIS CHIP'S SHAPE AND SURFACE (requested 2026-09-22): same 32px
     rounded square, same glassy fill, same rim and lift. Added to the SELECTOR rather than
     copied into the caret's own rule so the two cannot drift — one surface, one definition.
     The caret keeps its own rule below for what is genuinely button-only: the appearance
     reset, the pointer cursor, and the hover/active/focus states a static chip has no use for.
     Focused View re-skins this chip via `.ub-boards-page__section-icon` in _focused-view.scss;
     the caret is listed there too, for the same reason. */
}
.ub-boards-page__section-icon, .ub-boards-page__folders-chevron-btn {
