.ub-boards-page__folders-chevron-btn {
  /* READS AS A BUTTON (requested 2026-09-22). It was a bare transparent icon — no surface,
     no edge — so nothing said it was pressable; with the caret now right-aligned there is
     also no heading beside it to borrow affordance from.
     Deliberately the SAME family as `&__folders-action-btn` (the New folder / Tag a board
     pills in this very header) rather than a new look: white surface, the same border token,
     a layered lift that stops a control sinking into the card's cool-blue gradient. (The pills
     dropped their 1px top highlight on 2026-09-30; this button keeps the shared one.)
