     <button> needs and a <span> chip does not. The icon centres via that rule's
     inline-flex + `justify-content: center`, with `padding: 0` so the 32px box is the
     target rather than padding around a glyph. */
  appearance: none;
  padding: 0;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  cursor: pointer;
  /* 641-900px: the header is a plain flex row with `align-items: stretch`, so the caret —
     which has a fixed 32px height — pinned to the TOP of a 76px row while the action pills
     sat centred below it. Measured 102-134 against the pills' 117-125. Centring it lines the
