   scaled to 0.7 of each size preset so the row doesn't eat the screen. The user's
   size preference is used at full size; this scales it DOWN on smaller viewports in
   EITHER dimension (so both a short landscape screen and a narrow portrait one are
   covered). Each reduced value is precomputed (= round(original * 0.7)). */
@media (max-height: 500px), (max-width: 600px) {
  .md-board-detail-sentence-row.md-board-detail-sentence-bar--small {
    --nb-sb-h: 60px;
    --nb-sb-h2: 120px;
    --nb-sb-ph: 55px;
    --nb-sb-ph2: 109px;
