   heights, images, fonts, icons) by each class's own height ratio so the row
   adjusts to the shorter bar instead of clipping. After the <=500h block so it
   overrides at equal specificity (both media queries match at <=400px). The
   <=500h toggle/home/svg shrink still applies here and stretches to the row.
   Also fires on very NARROW widths (<=420px, portrait phones), mirroring the
   <=600px width added to the <=500h block above; the width thresholds nest the
