     Bumped to 32×32 — passes WCAG AA's 24px minimum.
     44×44 would dominate the filter chip layout. */
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  min-width: 32px;
  min-height: 32px;
  border: none;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-radius: 50%;
