/* Same glass-tile primitive as `.la-gif-modal__action` (:106638) and the share
   modal's tiles, so hover, focus and depth stay identical across modals. Two
   deliberate departures, both AAC-driven:
     - 18px ($aac-font-size-md) rather than the 15px those modals use. Their size
