   Requested: "modern view gentle: On >900px width move the stats page content up on the page".

   IT WAS THE LOWEST PAGE IN THE SECTION, measured as the y of "Activity for <user>": 146 at
   1280, 158 at 1024, 170 at 950, against the account page's 105/101/101. Two boxes held it
