                         from; Reports is in the section and was not
     workspace 40 margin -> 0, and its padding pinned at 40 rather than the base's 40/40/52
   That leaves the workspace's own 40px inset, the hero's 24 and the title's 16, and lands the
   title on y=106 at every width above 900 -- the line the gentle alignment block names as this
